るような気もしますが","ts":"1624713759.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FZb+M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01e2cb3c-b1d2-4252-af12-12e1ced3fb31","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Goの人は今のところsimple好きな人が多いけど、easyな選択肢もあっていいしもっと受け入れてもいいのではと思った\n使い分ければよいし","ts":"1624713435.030400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"niN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"305b16b2-a015-4b37-b662-d8ebc5824dd2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"アイコンが:cow:だったりしますか?(ないか)","ts":"1624697444.029300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rDs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a02fbae-f5ff-4d69-b082-106ff4aecc54","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"grpc-gateway使ってる。","ts":"1624697351.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7kvN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"131bdac6-ec74-4ae7-83c7-c95d8b54ec1a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあHTTP semanticsとその実装として1.1/2/3が整理されるので\nわりと楽にはなりそうかなと思ったり","ts":"1624696807.028400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gIm5j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7049c8ef-3d35-4614-bc79-59625a5c8112","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"HTTP 1.1/2 版を gRPC-Web って呼んでるのはブラウザの都合だけだと解釈してます","ts":"1624696546.027400","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1624696569.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/Wq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43675be1-c4d7-4e72-92cc-a939ae99565d","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まあでも HTTP 2 から 3 はすっと移行できるようになるんじゃないですかね","ts":"1624696486.025700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EYic"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05717e7d-e925-4226-9eb9-a8a49c31fa8a",