r":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"CDN, WAF, Ingress, Sidecarって考えただけでもだいぶデバッグ難易度あがってくる...","ts":"1624695920.010200","edited":{"user":"UNJ2DANJC","ts":"1624695939.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZVn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca24f28d-a918-4c45-8ed6-8e18156b87b5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"まあでも protobuf での JSONSchema 生成も辛そうなので実質 protobuf == gRPC なわけなんですけどね...","ts":"1624695890.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0lYzj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27a3a213-b2fb-4c83-9a12-89d5da37abdf","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"んで、gRPC-web だとリバプロ必須っていう...","ts":"1624695766.006100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ufU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fada6a7-6475-4eca-b79b-11f53bda95f2","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"envoy挟むと確かにちょっとややこしくなる...","ts":"1624695733.005400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L2kDz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e54f374a-8c14-4277-b462-77970c247065","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"protobuf が欲しいのか gRPC が欲しいのか、という問いは無限(有限)回なげた...","ts":"1624695671.004300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VaEvb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ece2c8b-10ba-43d6-bc0f-3f4897dded93","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、HTTP使う人だって通信したいだけでHTTPしたいわけじゃないの多いしね...みたいなもんだしね","ts":"1624695662.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0rn91"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39e3f8e3-c59d-448b-bb6a-2c446e99eb63","type":"message","user":"U023Z8L90BG","text":"gRPC、辛いのは（OSIじゃなくGoの中での）トランスポート層なのでHTTP2のノウハウ持ってる人が運用するか、その辺り全部お任せでやってくれるマネージドネットワークが無いと辛い印象あります。\nあと、gRPC導入したがる人は単にスキーマ付きのAPIが欲しいだけで、あんまりその辺りの低レイヤの運用を意識してくれない人が多い印象で、そうなると辛くなりがちですね。","ts":"1624695548.001700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U01BNGU2BLK","UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ScDTW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a4dd271-87b8-40b4-a21d-b33412e18939","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あと、問答無用でリクエスト全部メモリ上に持たれるので、デカいデータ扱うときには工夫がいる","ts":"1624694512.497300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Gbn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87ded5ae-ca2e-4aae-8ebd-d99d6d514cd3","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"grpc-go は通信が gRPC 判定されるまで何も言わずに通信叩き落とすので、k8s みたいに他段リバプロ \u0026amp;\u0026amp; ユーザーから見えないリバプロがいる、みたいな状況下でのデバッグがつらい...","ts":"1624694337.494500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ZHV="}]},{"client_msg_id":"a069df78-529b-4258-ae9f-20d1ba6034e5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"gRPC、デバッグもーちょい楽になってほしい...","ts":"1624694184.490600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F3U8I"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01KMGMSEEQ","text":"\u003c@U01KMGMSEEQ\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1624692704.489500","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2c7aff02-715c-443c-8fe5-64a8cb3b564f","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"フレームワークとは言わないのかもしれないけど最近仕事で触ってるgrpc-webの開発体験が結構良くて「俺が求めていたのはこれだ...なんで今まで触らなかった...」になってる","ts":"1624690837.489300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JXr6H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df45948f-e554-4492-8c8c-2f9ffb898da3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":wakaru:","ts":"1624690616.486900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FrM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abb4fd5d-1d50-417e-ac27